---
// Static inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids/markers. All values come from the code shown next to the figure in the post.
---
<figure class="gp7l">
  <div class="gp7l-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 320" role="img" aria-label="Two timelines of lookup. With an unbuffered channel the helper goroutine&#x27;s send at about 10 ms has no receiver, because lookup already returned at 1 ms, so it waits forever. With a buffer of 1 the send fits and the goroutine exits.">
<text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>ch := make(chan int)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch := make(chan int)</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="63" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>lookup</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lookup</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="119" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>helper goroutine</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>goroutine phụ</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="46" width="180" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="240.0" y="63.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>waits in select</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chờ trong select</tspan></text>
<line class="vline" x1="330" y1="42" x2="330" y2="96"/>
<text x="342" y="63" class="strong"><tspan data-lang-en>1 ms: timer wins, returns -1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 ms: timer thắng, trả về -1</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="102" width="390" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="345.0" y="119.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>time.Sleep(10 * time.Millisecond)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>time.Sleep(10 * time.Millisecond)</tspan></text>
<rect class="bad" x="540" y="102" width="320" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="700" y="119" class="badtx" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>ch &lt;- 42 waits forever</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch &lt;- 42 chờ mãi</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="190" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>ch := make(chan int, 1)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch := make(chan int, 1)</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="229" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>lookup</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lookup</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="285" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>helper goroutine</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>goroutine phụ</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="212" width="180" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="240.0" y="229.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>waits in select</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chờ trong select</tspan></text>
<line class="vline" x1="330" y1="208" x2="330" y2="262"/>
<text x="342" y="229" class="strong"><tspan data-lang-en>1 ms: timer wins, returns -1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 ms: timer thắng, trả về -1</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="268" width="390" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="345.0" y="285.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>time.Sleep(10 * time.Millisecond)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>time.Sleep(10 * time.Millisecond)</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="540" y="268" width="90" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="585.0" y="285.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>ch &lt;- 42</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch &lt;- 42</tspan></text>
<text x="642" y="285" class="strong"><tspan data-lang-en>fits in the buffer, goroutine exits</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vào bộ đệm, goroutine thoát</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption><span data-lang-en>Same function, one change. Not to scale: the 1 ms timer and the 10 ms sleep are the values in the code above.</span><span data-lang-vi>Cùng một hàm, chỉ đổi một chỗ. Không vẽ đúng tỉ lệ: timer 1 ms và sleep 10 ms là các giá trị trong đoạn code ở trên.</span></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp7l { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp7l-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp7l svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp7l text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp7l .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp7l .lane { fill: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7l .bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7l .wait { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7l .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7l .badtx { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp7l .mute { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7l .strong { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7l .vline { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7l .vline.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp7l .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp7l .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7l .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp7l figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
